            "description": "# getblocks\n\n### MatchMeta.Info\n\n0. ami\n1. path\n2. file\n3. size\n4. md5\n5. sha256\n6. b3\n7. md5path\n8. sha256path\n9. b3path\n10. md5dir\n11. sha256dir\n12. b3dir\n13. md5name\n14. sha256name\n15. b3name\n\n### FileBlock.Info\n\n0. ami\n1. b3\n2. size\n3. entropy\n4. block\n5. offset\n\n### Local Development\n\n```\npython setup.py install --user\n```\n",
